<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Votre Dossier Médical — Sosi</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { background: #fafafa; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1f2937; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            background: #ef4444;
            padding: 40px 36px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header-app  { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: white; margin-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
        .header-sub  { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
        .header-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 18px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Corps */
        .body { background: white; padding: 40px; }

        .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .intro { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 32px; }

        /* Card dossier */
        .dossier-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .dossier-card-header {
            background: #111827;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .dossier-card-title { display: table-cell; color: white; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; vertical-align: middle; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .dossier-card-id    { display: table-cell; text-align: right; color: #ef4444; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; vertical-align: middle; }
        .dossier-card-body  { padding: 24px; }

        .field { margin-bottom: 16px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f9fafb; }
        .field:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; }
        .field-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 900; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .field-value { font-size: 14px; color: #374151; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500; }
        .field-empty { font-size: 13px; color: #d1d5db; font-style: italic; }

        /* Alerte allergie */
        .allergy-box {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fee2e2;
            border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
        }
        .allergy-warn { font-weight: 900; color: #991b1b; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .allergy-text { color: #b91c1c; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }

        /* Boutons */
        .btn-section { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: #ef4444; color: white; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #111827; color: white; }

        /* Warning */
        .warning-box {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .footer strong { color: #4b5563; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">

    {# ── HEADER ── #}
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-app">🏥 SOSI</div>
        <div class="header-sub">VOTRE SANTÉ, NOTRE PRIORITÉ</div>
        <div class="header-badge">DOSSIER MÉDICAL SÉCURISÉ</div>
    </div>

    {# ── CORPS ── #}
    <div class="body">

        <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ user.prenom }} {{ user.nom }},</p>
        <p class="intro">
            Veuillez trouver ci-dessous un récapitulatif de votre dossier médical <strong>#{{ dossier.id }}</strong>. Ce document a été généré pour votre suivi personnel.
        </p>

        {# ── CARD DOSSIER ── #}
        <div class="dossier-card">
            <div class="dossier-card-header">
                <span class="dossier-card-title">Résumé de santé</span>
                <span class="dossier-card-id">ID: {{ dossier.id }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dossier-card-body">

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">📅 Création</div>
                    <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.dateCreation|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">🔄 Mise à jour</div>
                    <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.derniereMiseAJour|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</div>
                </div>

                {% if dossier.objectifSante %}
                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">🎯 Objectif</div>
                    <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.objectifSante }}</div>
                </div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">📋 Antécédents</div>
                    {% if dossier.antecedentsMedicaux %}
                        <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.antecedentsMedicaux }}</div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="field-empty">Aucun antécédent renseigné</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">🩺 Maladies chroniques</div>
                    {% if dossier.maladiesChroniques %}
                        <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.maladiesChroniques }}</div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="field-empty">Aucune maladie renseignée</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">⚠️ Allergies</div>
                    {% if dossier.allergies %}
                        <div class="allergy-box">
                            <div class="allergy-warn">Attention Médicale</div>
                            <div class="allergy-text">{{ dossier.allergies }}</div>
                        </div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="field-empty">Aucune allergie connue</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="field">
                    <div class="field-label">💊 Traitements</div>
                    {% if dossier.traitementsEnCours %}
                        <div class="field-value">{{ dossier.traitementsEnCours }}</div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="field-empty">Aucun traitement en cours</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# ── BOUTONS ── #}
        <div class="btn-section">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Consulter en ligne</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Accéder à SOSI</a>
        </div>

        {# ── AVERTISSEMENT ── #}
        <div class="warning-box">
            <strong>AVERTISSEMENT :</strong>
            Ce message et son contenu sont strictement confidentiels. Les informations médicales présentées
            ne remplacent pas un avis médical professionnel. Consultez votre médecin pour tout diagnostic ou changement de traitement.
        </div>

    </div>

    {# ── FOOTER ── #}
    <div class="footer">
        <strong>SOSI</strong> — Plateforme de Santé Connectée<br>
        Email envoyé à {{ user.email }}<br>
        Veuillez ne pas répondre à cet email automatique.
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
